  "title": "Fettuccini with Zucchini",
  "description": "Enjoy a fresh and flavorful saute of zucchini, colorful bell peppers and tomatoes seasoned with onion, garlic and a dash of cayenne pepper. Pour over hot fettuccini for a quick and easy meal.",
